{"screen_name": "poncon23", "file": "poncon23", "name": "ほぺもち", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1604051546605379584/SPmyyGLt.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1451938230392143875/1761814348/1500x500", "description": "Illustrator / 創作 / https://lit.link/hopemochi イラストの無断転載、無断使用、AI禁止", "total_works": 22, "scraped_works": 22, "first_seen": "2026-02-18T11:01:49.286197+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-18T11:01:49.286197+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-18T11:01:49.286197+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 15000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 15000, "max": 15000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/poncon23", "name": "poncon23"}, {"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@poncon23", "name": "poncon23"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://lit.link/hopemochi", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "works": [{"path": "/@poncon23/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f399b373/uploads/origins/daef9310-4b61-4ae2-9e8b-1436e9d6b722?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d062c5b87497f38ad1f4e7b834bac1cb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f399b373/uploads/origins/daef9310-4b61-4ae2-9e8b-1436e9d6b722?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d062c5b87497f38ad1f4e7b834bac1cb, https://si.imgix.net/f399b373/uploads/origins/daef9310-4b61-4ae2-9e8b-1436e9d6b722?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3289ba5e638c723db50afa99dff923e6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f399b373/uploads/origins/daef9310-4b61-4ae2-9e8b-1436e9d6b722?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=751feb2475dd5e7db5abcc9a4f46e0fc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really love previous art you did for me and I would be happy if you can draw my original characters this time!\n\nSakari, 24yo, 179cm. He's knight of royal guard, Quite depressed because he feels guilty about his past. Looking for redemption he joined army. For some reason people really likes him even with his pessimistic nature, and that overwhelms him, because he's scared of entering any new relationships. Quite a drinker, sad, but always trying to do his best.\n\nArinelle, 19yo, 169cm, water mage. Girl that fell in love with him, try to support him, but he still don't want to open too much. She is still his best friend. She also has tragic past, but in contrary she was able to overcome dark past (her village was set on fire).\n\nEinar - 27yo, 184cm, diplomat, visiting Sakari and Arin country because of work, mysterious and flirtatious, smug, really confident. Caught interest in both of them, like to tease other two.\n\nThey mostly spend time in local tavern or library. But I will be happy with any other setting! \nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OVB8IEInTmeG1GMrVZs6Pzre50bvupt2", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/af14598e/uploads/origins/9e10079f-c0fd-4c27-a4f0-c66a894c07a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=437f723114ff8ebe265cc6800a375afd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/af14598e/uploads/origins/9e10079f-c0fd-4c27-a4f0-c66a894c07a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=437f723114ff8ebe265cc6800a375afd, https://si.imgix.net/af14598e/uploads/origins/9e10079f-c0fd-4c27-a4f0-c66a894c07a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8a02efc7a00a5f26023410a491ed4b9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/af14598e/uploads/origins/9e10079f-c0fd-4c27-a4f0-c66a894c07a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31616f573ae49bef42f6016cf51dba24 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Sensei! I love your art and would like to request a group drawing. I hope it's okay to ask for so many characters, but please feel free to cancel if it’s too much! I hope the amount is enough.\n\n▶ I'd like an elegant group picture of my OCs, similar to this example. I can imagine something with a mansion theme as a background.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PcIDyqrkK-LDwHDjy2GlgACt-zygAVbl\n\nExpressions and poses are up to you, and please arrange them however you feel works best. But please do not change their design!\n\n▶ Here’s some basic info about the family:\n\n1. Blue-haired man with glasses, the husband and head of the family. He’s the Count. If possible, please have him holding a walking cane.\n2. Blonde woman, the first wife. She’s kindhearted and the mother of the son.\n3. Long blue-haired woman, the second wife. A beautiful woman married to the Count due to complicated family reasons.\n4. Blue-haired young man, the elder son of the first wife. He has a proud personality.\n5. Blue-haired young girl, the younger daughter of the second wife. She has a calm personality.\n\nIt would be an honor if you accept this request. Thank you so much in advance, and have a wonderful day!\n\n▶ Character Reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aA2-yt9uWHQ40UHcmhWT7-yBoPMiStze", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fe6b64c9/uploads/origins/bcc89229-db9d-480b-a8b8-c406738c656c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6243d9eddc0b656720f6461f186b6055", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fe6b64c9/uploads/origins/bcc89229-db9d-480b-a8b8-c406738c656c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6243d9eddc0b656720f6461f186b6055, https://si.imgix.net/fe6b64c9/uploads/origins/bcc89229-db9d-480b-a8b8-c406738c656c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr