txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=054bfebb03ed148324614450bddb5843 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/342b39ad/uploads/origins/80d607c6-06b1-4789-accb-45769ab5c22c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7df18a8c3f0ae72cefa0d665faa50ef", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/342b39ad/uploads/origins/80d607c6-06b1-4789-accb-45769ab5c22c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7df18a8c3f0ae72cefa0d665faa50ef, https://si.imgix.net/342b39ad/uploads/origins/80d607c6-06b1-4789-accb-45769ab5c22c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bca0cfa195e8f147b94e14941c20359 2x, https://si.imgix.net/342b39ad/uploads/origins/80d607c6-06b1-4789-accb-45769ab5c22c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3ce59fb09ae3bbf8086401e557b7a26 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you so much for accepting my previous request! I really love your style and how you portray the characters interacting. \n\nKesu is a Ruddy Shelduck demihuman/harpy that is 171 CM. Miu is a Black Nile spiny mouse demihuman and 164 CM. \n\nBoth characters reside in an Ancient Egyptian themed region. They are both very close companions, and enjoy traveling on their reed boat. If possible, I would like such a background from the point of view on the boat with the reed and palm Nilo river in their background.\n\nPlease appeal if the amount is insufficient for the request. Thank you so much for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YVZblztJjlQXDOqCHxHbH3eudedKlaRP", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/be567df7/uploads/origins/0c31d6bc-8e0d-4509-a628-254446aa430e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e898769f909667259856728a8fac7de", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/be567df7/uploads/origins/0c31d6bc-8e0d-4509-a628-254446aa430e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e898769f909667259856728a8fac7de, https://si.imgix.net/be567df7/uploads/origins/0c31d6bc-8e0d-4509-a628-254446aa430e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=122f331c0093a265771504332638d028 2x, https://si.imgix.net/be567df7/uploads/origins/0c31d6bc-8e0d-4509-a628-254446aa430e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c03e0c8f0b66555d420481ac5d25f5dd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして!\n先生のイラストの色の使い方はとても雰囲気があって好きです！もしよろしければ、2人のキャラクターがいる作品をお願いしたいです。\n\n白虎\n白髪\n179cm\nよく笑い、挑発的で、よくこっそりストリートファイトに参加している。\n野良猫に似ている\n\n愛染\nダークブルーの髪\n190cm\n自信家で、短気で、威圧的な表情をしている。気性が荒いながらも、自分の行動を管理しようと努力している。\n\n仲が良いというより喧嘩が多い、まるでずる賢い猫と警戒心の強い犬のような愛憎劇を繰り広げるが、それでもお互いを強く思い合っている。ポーズや表情は自由に描いてください！\n\nご検討ありがとうございました！ふさわしくない場合は、お気軽に辞退またはアピールしてください ^O^/\n\nhttps://sta.sh/215jxtrszo1m", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2a9c17f/uploads/origins/12661e24-fca6-4361-a00e-ae54279f7475?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2113e4c3a1ed19ff1d9572cd372d1299", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b2a9c17f/uploads/origins/12661e24-fca6-4361-a00e-ae54279f7475?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2113e4c3a1ed19ff1d9572cd372d1299, https://si.imgix.net/b2a9c17f/uploads/origins/12661e24-fca6-4361-a00e-ae54279f7475?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a06a9465ec7aea1acb26ac0ad093137 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b2a9c17f/uploads/origins/12661e24-fca6-4361-a00e-ae54279f7475?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20bf809564f61f5cebd18c2cd3602894 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you so much for the gorgeous art last time! I love it a lot. If you would like to draw them again, it would be cute if Theo had caught Flynn to protect him from falling, or protected him from an attack. https://toyhou.se/4518315.theo?key=ogq0Z3cVsCDlliT / https://toyhou.se/9130384.flynn?key=hfJnZk3GxURBOuT \nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d5c9f1dd/uploads/origins/37136ee6-956a-4f72-b7a0-e4099929c04f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=94de7b793df15496355d447e2731c2c9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d5c9f1dd/uploads/origins/37136ee6-956a-4f72-b7a0-e4099929c04f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=94de7b793df15496355d447e2731c2c9, https://si.imgix.net/d5c9f1dd/uploads/origins/37136ee6-956a-4f72-b7a0-e4099929c04f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=008a4682fa4c232ea15e7493333f5010 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d5c9f1dd/uploads/origins/37136ee6-956a-4f72-b7a0-e4099929c04f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9ca9e9cd7c24b88f10f26f53a50feb19 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/72261464/uploads/origins/d7473fda-5b9e-46b9-8c97-8f300ab57cc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e1e6440f25d9617aeea599f38f384f0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/72261464/uploads/origins/d7473fda-5b9e-46b9-8c97-8f300ab57cc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e1e6440f25d9617aeea599f38f384f0, https://si.imgix.net/72261464/uploads/origins/d7473fda-5b9e-46b9-8c97-8f300ab57cc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc5ef7138464f36bd34e1baa4b494701 2x, https://si.imgix.net/72261464/uploads/origins/d7473fda-5b9e-46b9-8c97-8f300ab57cc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f663d0965c75ce2205e956e7b73d6469 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really adore your art style, and want to request a drawing of my characters, Tristan and Alois.\n\nTristan (182):\n- God of order and equilibrium\n- Loyal dog, protector\n- Motifs: Chinese dragons, wolves, black holes, eclipses, eight-pointed stars, night.\n* Please note: He has scars all over his body, including on his neck, hands, and on the corner of his left eye. He has 4 piercings in his left ear and 2 piercings in his right ear.\n\nAlois (188):\n- God of chaos and origination\n- Quiet, calm\n- Motifs: Western dragons, comets, supernova, fallen angels, light.\n* Please note: He has the same earring on both sides. His hair ribbon is pale iridescent.\n\nThey are lovers who promise to find each other in every universe. I hope you are able to draw freely and have fun with the illustration.\n\nThank you for reading and considering my request! I hope you have a wonderful day! ٩(｡•́‿•̀｡)۶\n\nReference images: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uZmjMY7INo7A9qeYJqJhR8j0zWNXaocF?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6aecfb88/uploads/origins/e39a75a0-c271-4681-94a8-420b3381e15b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=639889f38bb19b00fbd9b19881dedbd2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6aecfb88/uploads/origins/e39a75a0-c271-4681-94a8-420b3381e15b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=639889f38bb19b00fbd9b19881dedbd2, https://si.imgix.net/6aecfb88/uploads/origins/e39a75a0-c271-4681-94a8-420b3381e15b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a62d148e6d16573decbc8c8dc5c56af9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6aecfb88/uploads/origins/e39a75a0-c271-4681-94a8-420b3381e15b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d959bb504e58bac1634f6ef985c894f6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Good day Pepe,\n\nI really enjoy your illustrations and style and would like to request a scene of my OCs Thea and Hedylogos together. \n\nThey are both very close and enjoy the company of each other, and naturally, Hedylogos is always sweet talking Thea at every opportunity he can. They can either be found in the vicinity of the Temple of Aphrodite, or in gardens/natural settings enjoying the company and natural beauty.\n\nThey are in a Greco-Roman Ancient/Fantasy setting. Thea is 193 CM Tall. Hedylogos is 180 CM.\n\nThank you so much for your consideration!\n\nPlease appeal if the amount needs to be adjusted for the level of detail.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1BSLZJdt7lagwEn41-gNnPOmmyam5SAK3", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/35e9f63c/uploads/origins/122a1fe3-f018-4bc0-b3ce-dcf691dcc4a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36689d05f8af7c093a6f263201bafbf6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/35e9f63c/uploads/origins/122a1fe3-f018-4bc0-b3ce-dcf691dcc4a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36689d05f8af7c093a6f263201bafbf6, https://si.imgix.net/35e9f63c/uploads/origins/122a1fe3-f018-4bc0-b3ce-dcf691dcc4a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81d857541b383e258d4fddb40332dded 2x, https://si.imgix.net/35e9f63c/