&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1020a9fe6270e9e564be8cbedc11faf9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7ab2d53f/uploads/origins/05a829b3-d04d-482f-b89a-0df4064d8d57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1020a9fe6270e9e564be8cbedc11faf9, https://si.imgix.net/7ab2d53f/uploads/origins/05a829b3-d04d-482f-b89a-0df4064d8d57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c8c3887f464040b194f5ffa9c565a55e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7ab2d53f/uploads/origins/05a829b3-d04d-482f-b89a-0df4064d8d57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5db516016eed3a48e62e6e702f75328c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9a5d836c/uploads/origins/79fc8b63-ce70-4812-b9be-3452736e8984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ba2c23af59200b24308a15eaaeb2b2e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9a5d836c/uploads/origins/79fc8b63-ce70-4812-b9be-3452736e8984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ba2c23af59200b24308a15eaaeb2b2e, https://si.imgix.net/9a5d836c/uploads/origins/79fc8b63-ce70-4812-b9be-3452736e8984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21c4b3bbf18869670ff3b9e6f614f9c1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9a5d836c/uploads/origins/79fc8b63-ce70-4812-b9be-3452736e8984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3f8f7fe24839f07f0c966476e4fcd18 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, your art is so pretty!! I would love it if you drew a scene of my two characters who are a couple!\n\nCharacter (A): https://toyhou.se/93891.lacie/gallery\nName: Lacie\nFemale, 5'2\" / 158 cm\nShe’s a calm and graceful mage who uses swirling and sparkling icy magic.\n\nCharacter (B): https://toyhou.se/20876806.soren/gallery\nName: Soren\nMale, 6'0\" / 183 cm\nHe’s a confident and outgoing magic knight who uses water magic. He has wolf ears, and the blue diamonds in his design are gemstones.\n\nIn their relationship, Lacie (A) is the more reserved and shy one while Soren (B) is warmer and more energetic. \n\nPlease feel free to draw them in any setting and composition! Thank you so much!!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b4e104de/uploads/origins/5b984268-9355-4c21-8390-ae7fea215384?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d259d69b01a9d1a76de10c74e4d63de3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b4e104de/uploads/origins/5b984268-9355-4c21-8390-ae7fea215384?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d259d69b01a9d1a76de10c74e4d63de3, https://si.imgix.net/b4e104de/uploads/origins/5b984268-9355-4c21-8390-ae7fea215384?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce022c06aae68b9ba216da3ddbe16d96 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b4e104de/uploads/origins/5b984268-9355-4c21-8390-ae7fea215384?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=586f34966f5a34869659db31ac02704b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I love your artwork. I wanted to get a drawing with two characters.\n\nMarcel ♂ (180cm) - Blonde hair. A noble king. He is kind and patient, and is a clever and gentle ruler. He has ice magic and has a rapier. He views Beyan very highly, even when others disagree. Beyan brings out a playful and expressive side of him. His motifs are: sun, moon, metal, ice, and dawn. He has freckles and a circlet crown.\n\nBeyan ♂ (178cm) - Brown hair. He was a hero in his youth, but now he is viewed as a villain. He is sly, confident, and dramatic. He has fire magic. The flames are red, purple, and black. His braid is optional. He often teases Marcel, and can be very gentle towards him. His motifs are: sun, moon, fire, smoke, and stars.\n\nThey are childhood friends and later become lovers. They have a very warm and gentle love, and dance and laugh together. They have matching red crystals (Marcel’s hair tie and Beyan’s hand). \n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ujpyXqWMb0xo-0zzdCnnL3tVMyZgtQeG?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6b94b4e3/uploads/origins/748aa048-9d40-4291-b11b-ccd0b5c8420f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e4c65f8af4ab774c9c0451d9e28ea78a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6b94b4e3/uploads/origins/748aa048-9d40-4291-b11b-ccd0b5c8420f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e4c65f8af4ab774c9c0451d9e28ea78a, https://si.imgix.net/6b94b4e3/uploads/origins/748aa048-9d40-4291-b11b-ccd0b5c8420f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e9357a932b55356033b32fd61e2f153e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6b94b4e3/uploads/origins/748aa048-9d40-4291-b11b-ccd0b5c8420f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=dd1bc63ae7725a913f5534b20d0f3e27 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9dd12ec1/uploads/origins/d04cb940-0544-4ceb-bfa6-3278b2b67129?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e78a69f63e86c017d1db573875b620d7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9dd12ec1/uploads/origins/d04cb940-0544-4ceb-bfa6-3278b2b67129?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e78a69f63e86c017d1db573875b620d7, https://si.imgix.net/9dd12ec1/uploads/origins/d04cb940-0544-4ceb-bfa6-3278b2b67129?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7c16c066f50ebc138ae5afa5fe2d3f2d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9dd12ec1/uploads/origins/d04cb940-0544-4ceb-bfa6-3278b2b67129?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fceaa3007ce85fdbe8db9806fcb72523 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/682308f5/uploads/origins/04fd8e33-9c5c-4495-bc0f-91c913713179?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0349127e52c5e5d350188ff8fbffd935", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/682308f5/uploads/origins/04fd8e33-9c5c-4495-bc0f-91c913713179?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0349127e52c5e5d350188ff8fbffd935, https://si.imgix.net/682308f5/uploads/origins/04fd8e33-9c5c-4495-bc0f-91c913713179?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a27bc593cb0fc54b1f482623d92ea3f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/682308f5/uploads/origins/04fd8e33-9c5c-4495-bc0f-91c913713179?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31deaf4f3be601912c60804c22d645a7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi there, I'm fascinated by your works! Can I request an illustration for my original characters?\n\nThe slime girl called Vita is an adventurer using bow and arrow as her weapon, she's a kind and cute girl, but also a bit childish and tsundere.\nThe male called Zealour owns a magic shop. He always seems nice and gentle, takes care of Vita but also likes to tease her. He is actually a silver dragon in human form, good at ice magic.\n\nIt's medieval fantasy setting. Please feel free to draw! Maybe the images from reference folder \"Commissions together\" can also provide you some ideas.\n\nPlease sign on a separate layer in the .psd file if possible.\nThank you so much, but if you don’t like it, please feel free to cancel.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/225m1nh2zz3x", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@poncon23/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/854d64fd/uploads/origins/c8fac1b1-7308-416e-8a4b-e15faa62ebab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dee32224fa557a66108b61d6600aac50", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/854d64fd/uploads/origins/c8fac1b1-7308-416e-8a4b-e15faa62ebab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dee32224fa557a66108b61d6600aac50, https://si.imgix.net/854d64fd/uploads/origins/c8fac1b1-7308-416e-8a4b-e15faa62ebab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef54b8418b111525a4d63ba80422ed69 2x, https://si.imgix.net/854d64fd/uploads/origins/c8fac1b1-7308-416e-8a4b-e15faa62ebab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d674a98d10de3be53deb49618575e18c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ぺぺ様、はじめまして！ツイッターでイラストを楽しく拝見させて頂きました。素敵な絵柄に惹かれて、可能ならば自キャラを依頼したいと思っております。\n\n【依頼内容】\nキャラ参照は下記のURLをご覧ください。南東アジアの様なトロピカル島国に旅をしていて、凸凹コンビで喧嘩すればするほど仲がいい、親友家族恋人相棒のお2人です。一緒に未知か禁じられた廃墟や遺跡を探索している、所謂トゥームレイダーの様な存在です。褐色肌の子は楽天家でお喋りなタイプ、黒髪の子は不器用でクールな性格。対照的な2人ですが、「一緒にいれば自分の世界はどんどん広がっていく」様な関係性です。\n\n【テーマ】\n・可能ならば、「旅」のテーマの一枚をお願い致します。トロピカルな設定やモチーフに限らず、お好きな世界観をご自由に描いてください！\n・一緒に遺跡や街を探索するか、キャンプするか、旅先を決めようとしているか、シチュエーションは何でも構いません。\n・新しい世界に訪れて沢山な不思議なものと人々を触れて、色鮮やかで楽しい雰囲気な一枚をお願い致します。\n・「夏、海原、異国、地平線、民族風」のモチーフをどちらでもご自由に使って大丈夫です。\n・ポーズや構図は他は何でも構いませんので、お気軽に描いてください！\n\n依頼内容に何か難しい点か問題点があれば、お気になさらずこの依頼をキャンセルしてください。ご検討のほど、何卒よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2fyugi847h4", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}